# Build context: ./frontend
#
# The image needs (see Dockerfile):
#   index.html
#   config.js
#   docker-entrypoint.d/
#   waveform-prototype.html (Phase 2B renderer-UAT prototype)
#   vendor/ (vendored plotting-library static builds, see vendor/README.md)
# None of those are excluded below. Note in particular that config.js must
# remain available: it is the checked-in default that the entrypoint rewrites
# from API_BASE_URL at container start.

# Secrets must never enter an image. The **/ prefix matters: .dockerignore
# patterns are matched against the whole relative path, so a bare ".env" would
# only exclude one at the context root.
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Node tooling, should any be introduced later
**/node_modules/
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/.npm/
**/.cache/

# Editor / OS artefacts
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.swp
**/*.tmp
**/*.log
